    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E66. 618好物大公开！吃喝日用影视一网打尽！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a2e1e0143a22a6955835b4b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a2e1e0143a22a6955835b4b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 14 Jun 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：辣的叫老爷/麦乐鸡</span></p><p><span>哈喽啊大家，不知道大家618买了什么好东西呢？久违的好物分享来啦！</span></p><p><span>本期好物清单</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>吃 </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a></span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>盒马 红豆玉米须南瓜水 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="71">01:11</a></span></p></li><li><p><span>吾岛 美拉德无蔗糖希腊酸奶 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a></span></p></li><li><p><span>礼厚茶肆 冬瓜奇兰海石花 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="571">09:31</a></span></p></li><li><p><span>月亮兜兜 贵州酸汤粉 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a></span></p></li><li><p><span>Penn State Pretzels香葱酸奶油碱水结 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="881">14:41</a></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong><span>用 </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1066">17:46</a></span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>伊索香水 蓓芳（Aurner）<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1077">17:57</a></span></p></li><li><p><span>odette e odile 的子品牌SY&nbsp;闪片鞋<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1363">22:43</a></span></p></li></ul></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnPWC_Hw5vINnNJ_rcaxY_uZPjaN.png"><ul><li><p><span> Lululemon Speed Up女士运动高腰短裤2.5"内衬款 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1608">26:48</a>（货号LW7AY3S）</span></p></li><li><p><span>娇韵诗 男士保湿啫喱 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1826">30:26</a></span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmMnMClfgurteIYeeIkOut-wJf8k.jpg"><ul><li><p><span>Rhode腮红棒 - toasted teddy <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1936">32:16</a></span></p></li><li><p><strong><span>保健类 </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2146">35:46</a></span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>参天 玻璃酸钠保湿滴眼液（更正：玻璃酸钠含量应该是0.1%！！！工作人员你骗我！！！也不排除是我自己记错了，不好意思各位！！！！）<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2158">35:58</a></span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk2Ow3CFyoeHdsSUAFFYkEoF7BIc.jpg"><p></p></li><li><p><span>西班牙Aquilea褪黑素 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2487">41:27</a></span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqXdSnBcTijFc66uYD895-WxwLlg.jpg"><p></p></li><li><p><strong><span>影视 </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2714">45:14</a></span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>给阿嬷的情书 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2736">45:36</a></span></p></li><li><p><span>蓝眼武士 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3328">55:28</a></span></p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><p><span>好啦，以上就是我们的推荐，不知道大家有什么好物推荐呢，也欢迎和我们互相安利！</span></p><p><em><span>*如果有希望加入我们听友群的听众，也可以点击：播客名片-联系我们-点击微信图标（需要出示收听本节目5小时记录截图哦~）</span></em><br></p><p></p>]]></description>
